-- test: at a parameter of a function type in the state, the flow runs the other way: a `step` whose state is a function taking `secret Int` would pass `secret` data to the function `init` returns, which takes `Int`, so it is U4001 (spec/26 §2)
-- spec: spec/26 §2
-- expect: error U4001 at src/counter.una:10:18
module counter

import std.drive (Tick)

pub init() -> fn(Int) -> Int = double

pub step(edit f: fn(secret Int) -> Int, input: secret Tick) -> Unit = unit

double(x: Int) -> Int = x * 2
